# .delphi/versions: one line per Delphi version, oldest first: `<version> <hash> <what changed>`, the
# hash being that of the files .delphi/manifest.yml lists. Only add lines; `bash .delphi/version.sh`
# prints the first two fields for the files as they are now.
0.0.1 1fc1890f7d00 versions and migrations; linked/ are read-only copies, not link.sh worktrees (migration)
